{"id":"n67601-1-7","stage":3,"title":"에스컬레이터 · 扶梯","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67601-1-7-1","ko":"다리가 아파서 계단을 어떻게 올라갈지 걱정이네.","zh":"我的腿很疼，真担心该怎么上楼梯呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다리가","meaning":"腿，下肢","explanation":"다리：腿，下肢；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"다리","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62840","senseId":"1","lemma":"다리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아파서","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계단을","meaning":"阶梯，楼梯","explanation":"계단：阶梯，楼梯；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"계단","audio":"/audio/cbd5d64a59da9222d592.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23937","senseId":"1","lemma":"계단","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올라갈지","meaning":"上，上去","explanation":"올라가다：上，上去；ㄹ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"올라가다","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89867","senseId":"1","lemma":"올라가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걱정이네.","meaning":"担心，忧虑，担忧","explanation":"걱정：担心，忧虑，担忧；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"걱정","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17232","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"982037b144c2b329","term":"다리","zh":"腿，下肢","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3","entryId":"62840","definition":"人或动物身体下的，做站、走、跳的动作的身体部位。","pronunciation":["다리"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"cbd5d64a59da9222","term":"계단","zh":"阶梯，楼梯","audio":"/audio/cbd5d64a59da9222d592.mp3","entryId":"23937","definition":"为了上下走动而按顺序把小台阶倾斜连接起来的设施。","pronunciation":["계단","게단"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"bfc58fbbb2f76325","term":"올라가다","zh":"上，上去","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3","entryId":"89867","definition":"从下向上，从低处前往高处。","pronunciation":["올라가다"]},{"id":"7582493f75565a84","term":"걱정","zh":"担心，忧虑，担忧","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3","entryId":"17232","definition":"害怕发生不好的事情而感到不安。","pronunciation":["걱쩡"]}],"audio":"/audio/29ffda37da04def6cc74.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67601-1-7-2","ko":"어르신, 뒤쪽의 에스컬레이터를 이용하세요.","zh":"老人家，请使用后面的自动扶梯吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어르신,","meaning":"老人家，老伯，尊长","explanation":"어르신：老人家，老伯，尊长","readings":[{"term":"어르신","audio":"/audio/b48d927c3256dc3fc017.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70493","senseId":"2","lemma":"어르신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뒤쪽의","meaning":"后面，后头，后部","explanation":"뒤쪽：后面，后头，后部；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"뒤쪽","audio":"/audio/464ac5d0424e6b596506.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66947","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒤쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"에스컬레이터를","meaning":"扶梯","explanation":"에스컬레이터：扶梯；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"에스컬레이터","audio":"/audio/6bc97d9b6032c2ae34f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67601","senseId":"1","lemma":"에스컬레이터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이용하세요.","meaning":"使用","explanation":"이용하다：使用；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"이용하다","audio":"/audio/c64e2b01ae17b5d15f30.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70751","senseId":"1","lemma":"이용하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b48d927c3256dc3f","term":"어르신","zh":"老人家，老伯，尊长","audio":"/audio/b48d927c3256dc3fc017.mp3","entryId":"70493","definition":"(敬语)父亲的朋友或比父亲年长的长辈。","pronunciation":["어ː르신"]},{"id":"464ac5d0424e6b59","term":"뒤쪽","zh":"后面，后头，后部","audio":"/audio/464ac5d0424e6b596506.mp3","entryId":"66947","definition":"朝向的反方向。","pronunciation":["뒤ː쪽"]},{"id":"6bc97d9b6032c2ae","term":"에스컬레이터","zh":"扶梯","audio":"/audio/6bc97d9b6032c2ae34f3.mp3","entryId":"67601","definition":"可使人或货物等自动上下楼而建造的阶梯模样的装置。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"c64e2b01ae17b5d1","term":"이용하다","zh":"使用","audio":"/audio/c64e2b01ae17b5d15f30.mp3","entryId":"70751","definition":"根据需要有用或有益地利用对象。","pronunciation":["이ː용하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a6b42f5dd90d7b52b1fc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.19,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67601","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":116,"sequenceScore":3.0167,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["老人家，请使用后面的自动扶梯吧。","你到底和谁打架了，脸怎么全是血的？","我的腿很疼，真担心该怎么上楼梯呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["老人家，请使用后面的自动扶梯吧。","我的腿很疼，真担心该怎么上楼梯呢。","你到底和谁打架了，脸怎么全是血的？"],"answer":0}]}
